  "Four agent architectures from Russell and Norvig: reflex, goal-based, utility-based, and learning agents. Each names its idea in three lines and carries a small block diagram of its internal data flow from sensors through reasoning to actuators.": "Russell 和 Norvig 提出的四種代理程式架構：反射型、基於目標型、基於效用型和學習型代理程式。每種架構均用三行文字說明其核心思想，並配有一個小型框圖，展示從感測器經推理到執行器的內部資料流。",
