  "The same stateless model call, reached through two interfaces. The Chat Completions API: you resend the full messages array each turn and your code keeps the history. The Responses API: you send only new input plus a reference, and the server keeps the thread. Both feed the same stateless model, which receives the full context and returns one assistant turn (content, finish_reason, usage). They differ only in who keeps the conversation between turns.": "透過兩種介面存取同一個無狀態模型呼叫。Chat Completions API：您需要在每一輪重新傳送完整的 messages 陣列，並由程式碼儲存歷史記錄。Responses API：您只需傳送新輸入和一個引用，由伺服器儲存會話執行緒。兩者都會將內容傳給同一個無狀態模型；該模型接收完整上下文並傳回一輪助手回應（content、finish_reason、usage）。兩者的唯一區別是由誰在輪次之間儲存對話。",
