  "usage": "usage",
  "The agent loop drawn locally as a cycle. Step one, locally-sample: read a slice of the environment. Step two, locally-perceive: render that slice into a full engineered text context. That context holds the system prompt, the message history, prior tool results, and the sampled slice, all of it as plain text. The context is fed as text into one stateless text-to-text mapping, the LLM, which is the only model in the picture; perceive-to-act is collapsed into that single mapping. Its output is an intent signal, a typed tool call, not the action itself. Step three, locally-act: your code translates the intent into one bounded local environment update. Step four, locally-impact: the update changes the world, and the next local sample reads the changed world. Every box except the model is code you wrote; the model never touches the world, it only emits an intent the loop chooses to honor.": "以本機迴圈形式繪製的代理程式迴圈。第一步，locally-sample：讀取一部分環境。第二步，locally-perceive：將這一部分呈現為完整的工程化文字上下文。該上下文包含系統提示詞、訊息歷史記錄、先前的工具結果以及取樣片段，所有內容均為純文字。上下文以文字形式輸入一個無狀態的文字到文字對映，即 LLM，它是圖中唯一的模型；從感知到行動的過程被整合到這一對映中。模型輸出的是意圖訊號，即一種帶型別的工具呼叫，而非動作本身。第三步，locally-act：程式碼將意圖轉換為一次有明確邊界的本機環境更新。第四步，locally-impact：該更新改變世界，下一次本機取樣會讀取變化後的世界。除模型外，每個框都代表您編寫的程式碼；模型從不直接接觸世界，只會發出意圖，由迴圈決定是否執行。",
  "ENVIRONMENT · the only durable state": "環境 · 唯一的持久狀態",
  "A maze cell, a chat transcript, a folder of files, a sandbox. The agent reads a slice and writes a slice.": "一個迷宮單元格、一份聊天記錄、一個資料夾或一個沙箱。代理程式讀取其中一部分，並寫入其中一部分。",
