  "The general agent loop from Module 1a becomes the ReAct loop once the reasoning socket holds a language model. On the left, the general cycle: perception reads the world, a dashed swappable socket reasons, action changes the world. A bridge drops a language model into that socket. On the right, the same cycle driven by the model: it reasons, acts by calling a tool, and observes the tool's result, which re-enters the next reasoning step. Because the model works only in text, it reads a tool result in place of perceiving and emits a tool call to act.": "當推理插槽中裝入語言模型時，模組 1a 中的通用代理程式迴圈就會成為 ReAct 迴圈。左側是通用迴圈：感知讀取外部世界，虛線表示的可替換插槽負責推理，行動改變外部世界。透過橋接，將語言模型裝入該插槽。右側是由模型驅動的同一迴圈：模型進行推理，透過呼叫工具來行動，再觀察工具結果，該結果隨後進入下一步推理。由於模型只能處理文字，因此它以讀取工具結果代替感知，並透過發出工具呼叫來行動。",
