  "Lilian Weng's 2023 map of an LLM agent. A language model sits at the center as the agent. Memory is above it (branching into short-term and long-term memory), Action is below, Tools are on the left (Calendar, Calculator, CodeInterpreter, Search, and more), and Planning is on the right (reflection, self-critique, chain of thought, subgoal decomposition). The model is the core controller; memory, planning, tools, and action are components wired around it.": "Lilian Weng 於 2023 年繪製的 LLM 代理程式架構圖。語言模型位於中心，充當代理程式。上方是記憶（分為短期記憶和長期記憶），下方是行動，左側是工具（日曆、計算器、程式碼直譯器、搜尋等），右側是規劃（反思、自我批評、思維鏈、子目標分解）。模型是核心控制器；記憶、規劃、工具和行動是連線在其周圍的元件。",
