  "One turn of the ReAct loop as it runs in code. The model produces a Thought and either stops or requests a tool. On a tool request, the Action box runs your function and the Observation box appends the result to the messages array, then the loop returns to Thought. When finish_reason is stop, the turn exits to the final answer instead.": "ReAct 迴圈在程式碼中執行一輪的過程。模型生成一個思考結果，然後停止或請求工具。收到工具請求後，行動框執行函式，觀察框將結果追加到 messages 陣列，迴圈隨後傳回思考步驟。當 finish_reason 為 stop 時，本輪改為退出並生成最終答案。",
  "✓ final answer": "✓ 最終答案",
