  "Lost in the Middle, redrawn from Liu et al. 2023, mapped onto an agent's growing messages array. A U-shaped curve plots answer accuracy against where the needed text sits in the context. Accuracy is high at the start, where the system prompt is pinned, and at the end, where the latest tool result sits, but dips to its lowest in the middle. As the loop appends turns, the original request is pushed left from the fresh end into the weak middle, which is context rot.": "“Lost in the Middle”，根據 Liu et al. 2023 年的研究重繪，並對映到代理程式不斷增長的 messages 陣列。U 形曲線展示答案準確率與所需文字在上下文中所處位置的關係。準確率在開頭和末尾較高：開頭固定著系統提示詞，末尾則是最新的工具結果；而中間位置的準確率降至最低。隨著迴圈不斷追加輪次，原始請求會從末端的新近位置被向左推入薄弱的中間區域，這就是上下文退化。",
