  "A RAG architecture split into two timelines. Timeline 1, indexing, runs offline: a knowledge base of documents is preprocessed, embedded by an embedding model, and stored in a vector database. Timeline 2, serving, runs live: a user query reaches a chat app, is embedded, matched against the vector database, and the retrieved context with the query goes to the LLM engine, which streams back a grounded response.": "一個分為兩條時間線的 RAG 架構。時間線 1 為離線執行的索引建置：對文件知識庫進行預處理，透過嵌入模型生成嵌入，並儲存到向量資料庫中。時間線 2 為即時執行的服務：使用者查詢進入聊天應用，生成嵌入後與向量資料庫進行匹配；檢索到的上下文連同查詢一起傳送至 LLM 引擎，由該引擎以流式方式傳回有依據的回應。",
